%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dataweave-formats-json (言語ガイド)
doc と相違 (表記のみ: 引用符・括弧・書式の違いで、値は同じ)
doc の Output:
  {
    name: "Matias",
    age: 8,
    male: true,
    kids: null,
    brothers: [
      "Pedro",
      "Sara"
    ]
  }
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/dw
---
payload
%%% input payload application/json
{
  "name": "Matias",
  "age": 8,
  "male": true,
  "kids": null,
  "brothers": ["Pedro", "Sara"]
}
%%% output application/dw
{
  name: "Matias",
  age: 8,
  male: true,
  kids: null,
  brothers: [
    "Pedro", 
    "Sara"
  ]
} as Object {encoding: "UTF-8", mediaType: "application/json"}
